  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"AI of a CPU fighter: sets fighter_input,x and ai_command,x for this frame. X = fighter, opponent_index = the other fighter. Called by a JMP from fighter_get_input ($226d)."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent hit by this fighter?"},
    {"at":9,"placement":"side","text":"Flying kick: release at once"},
    {"at":13,"placement":"side","text":"Keep the attack input for the level time"},
    {"at":21,"placement":"side","text":"fighter_input keeps its last value"},
    {"at":31,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent holds the end pose of its move ($69)"},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"Levels 5 and up watch a held crouch"},
    {"at":45,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent crouches: test the own move like against a sweep"},
    {"at":52,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent retracts its move: no danger"},
    {"at":64,"placement":"side","text":"Attack flag of the opponent move"},
    {"at":71,"placement":"side","text":"Own move is a block ($13 or $14)?"},
    {"at":79,"placement":"side","text":"Block that stops the opponent move"},
    {"at":84,"placement":"side","text":"Correct block: keep it"},
    {"at":88,"placement":"side","text":"Command 1 = stand: the current move returns"},
    {"at":97,"placement":"side","text":"Own about turn in progress"},
    {"at":104,"placement":"side","text":"Stand, walk back or walk forward: react"},
    {"at":116,"placement":"side","text":"Own move holds its end pose: release it"},
    {"at":129,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent foot sweep or back sweep?"},
    {"at":137,"placement":"side","text":"Keep only crouch, low and sweep moves"},
    {"at":164,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent attack in range? Z = 1 out of range"},
    {"at":169,"placement":"side","text":"Reaction delay: 0 react, bit 7 reload, else count down"},
    {"at":198,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7: attack, bits 5-6: counter, none: special action"},
    {"at":212,"placement":"side","text":"Special action against this opponent move"},
    {"at":229,"placement":"side","text":"Block $13/$14 or jump $05 against the opponent move"},
    {"at":237,"placement":"side","text":"Own move runs backwards: keep the command"},
    {"at":241,"placement":"side","text":"Own move holds its end pose ($69)?"},
    {"at":251,"placement":"side","text":"About turn: complete it with a facing flip"},
    {"at":265,"placement":"side","text":"The end pose of move $12 is the mirrored stance"},
    {"at":289,"placement":"side","text":"Hold time = random AND mask + 5 or 6"},
    {"at":334,"placement":"side","text":"Same facing: one fighter shows the back to the other"},
    {"at":358,"placement":"side","text":"Distance of the opponent in front, signed"},
    {"at":360,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent close behind ($d5-$ff) or close in front (<$15): attack"},
    {"at":368,"placement":"side","text":"$80-$d4: opponent far behind: turn around"},
    {"at":378,"placement":"side","text":"Walking forward: maybe stop"},
    {"at":387,"placement":"side","text":"Stop time 0: walk on"},
    {"at":401,"placement":"side","text":"Walk time; 0 gives 256 frames"},
    {"at":412,"placement":"side","text":"Command $12 = about turn"},
    {"at":442,"placement":"side","text":"Negative = opponent in front"},
    {"at":444,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent close in front ($df-$ff) or close behind (<$1f): attack"},
    {"at":452,"placement":"side","text":"$80-$de: opponent far in front: walk"},
    {"at":459,"placement":"side","text":"Attack delay: bit 7 reload, else count down to the attack"},
    {"at":481,"placement":"side","text":"Entry also from ai_response_attack, without the delay"},
    {"at":493,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent in low block $13"},
    {"at":497,"placement":"side","text":"Opponent in high block $14"},
    {"at":507,"placement":"side","text":"Attack that the high block does not stop"},
    {"at":510,"placement":"side","text":"$07 needs a held crouch first"},
    {"at":536,"placement":"side","text":"Index $08-$32 = opponent behind, $33-$47 = in front"},
    {"at":543,"placement":"side","text":"Level spread of the index"},
    {"at":552,"placement":"side","text":"Foot sweep: only from level 2"},
    {"at":560,"placement":"side","text":"Roundhouse or back sweep: try a variant"},
    {"at":580,"placement":"line","text":"Unused: JMP ai_repeat_command after an RTS. Nothing jumps here. A leftover of an earlier exit of the attack timing."},
    {"at":589,"placement":"side","text":"Levels 0-1: no new command, the input stays"},
    {"at":597,"placement":"side","text":"Special action 5: crouch, then move $07"},
    {"at":611,"placement":"side","text":"Index $08-$28 = opponent in front, $29-$47 = behind"},
    {"at":640,"placement":"line","text":"Variant of move $0f or $10 (Y): bit 7 turn, $40-$7f walk back, $20-$3f move $08, 1-$1f the move, 0 move $09."},
    {"at":683,"placement":"line","text":"Steps the 8-bit random value ai_random (shift left, EOR #$1d on carry) and returns it in A. Carry = the bit that went out. Used by the AI and the demo set-up."},
    {"at":693,"placement":"line","text":"Copies the parameters of skill level cpu_skill,x and resets the AI state of both fighters. Called for fighter 0, then fighter 1, at bout set-up ($157a, $157f). Bug: the masks $82, $89, $8c, $91, $98, $a1 and the release times $96/$97 are written without X. The level of fighter 1 wins for both."},
    {"at":700,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters get this release time"},
    {"at":716,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters: reload the hold timer"},
    {"at":722,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters: command stand"},
    {"at":733,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters: reload the attack timer"},
    {"at":737,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters: no turn, no special action"},
    {"at":755,"placement":"side","text":"Only walk and stop masks use X"},
    {"at":764,"placement":"side","text":"Both fighters: walk decision next frame"},
    {"at":770,"placement":"side","text":"Reload the reaction delay"},
    {"at":778,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 1, against a flying kick: crouch, then foot sweep. Level 7 and up sweeps at frame $19 of the opponent, lower levels when it stands again."},
    {"at":818,"placement":"side","text":"Always taken"},
    {"at":820,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 3, against a low kick: flying kick $0e."},
    {"at":831,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 4, against a foot sweep or roundhouse: move $09."},
    {"at":842,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 5: crouch (command 4) until the crouch holds its end pose, then move $07."},
    {"at":864,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 8, against move $06: half the time special action 5, else as special action 6."},
    {"at":874,"placement":"side","text":"Bug: no X, writes the special action of fighter 0"},
    {"at":879,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 6, against move $18: move $06 or move $18, half the time each."},
    {"at":899,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 7, against a back sweep: back sweep $10 when the facings differ, else foot sweep $0a. No run executed it. Bug: Y is 14 from the dispatch, not the opponent index, so the compare reads fighter_move of fighter 0."},
    {"at":901,"placement":"side","text":"Reads $56 = fighter_move of fighter 0"},
    {"at":921,"placement":"line","text":"Special action 2, against moves $07, $0c and $11: foot sweep $0a. The action ends when the move $0a starts."},
    {"at":939,"placement":"line","text":"Jumps to special action A (1-8) through ai_special_jump_table. Y = 2*A, not the opponent index. Reached from ai_check_special ($1d62)."}
  ],
  "references": [],
  "operands": []
}
